{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>「億萬駙馬」伍富橋今個月中出席活動時宣布老婆梁兆楹（Shirley）已誕下愛兒，正式榮升新手父母，雖然Shirley提早近一個月誕下仔仔Julian，但她復原力驚人，未休息夠一個月已經開懷暢飲。日前（26日）二人在社交平台分享一家三口幸福滿滿的滿月宴照片，當時他們還特地把Julian的樣子用貼圖擋著，今日（28日）Julian的真面目大家終於能見到了，因為Shirley在社交平台分享了他睡著時的可愛樣子。</p><figure><img alt=\"伍富橋、梁兆楹。（IG@sysleungx）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261028/1192136566839971840690172.jpeg/qVXvlQE8hd3ccheZdpWoiBVwUPxKFTr6A6rAWQOqwFk\"/><figcaption>伍富橋、梁兆楹。（IG@sysleungx）</figcaption></figure><p>遺傳跳舞天份 愛犬𥄫實奶爸</p><p>Julian可能遺傳爸爸的跳舞天份，連睡著時都擺出拉丁舞手勢。Shirley更分享了不少Julian的片段，其中一段笑指新手奶爸伍富橋幫Julian換衣服換得太慢：「忟到要掹自己頭髮。」片中見到Julian用手拉著自己的頭髮，要媽媽Shirley拉著他的小手著他放鬆。除此之外Shirley更分享了家中的小狗對弟弟Julian的「保護慾」，見到「三哥」Pickle在伍富橋照顧Julian時在旁像監工一樣「𥄫到實」。</p><figure><img alt=\"Julian可能遺傳爸爸的跳舞天份，連睡著時都擺出拉丁舞手勢。(ig@sysleungx)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261028/1192194711793045504296107.jpeg/hldv9POg6FY54gK02GGb6uUjnQz4mXM7EE_QMBBP0DA\"/><figcaption>Julian可能遺傳爸爸的跳舞天份，連睡著時都擺出拉丁舞手勢。(ig@sysleungx)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Shirley笑指新手奶爸伍富橋幫Julian換衣服換得太慢，Julian狂掹頭髮。(ig@sysleungx)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261028/1192194709393772544359678.jpeg/ahKHMvmNmeh4lviIZvclGQURcy9ZIMnGpyZCWacmQlk\"/><figcaption>Shirley笑指新手奶爸伍富橋幫Julian換衣服換得太慢，Julian狂掹頭髮。(ig@sysleungx)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Julian狂掹頭髮，睇到都痛。(ig@sysleungx)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261028/1192194707023859712452706.jpeg/RLce8CvCj5KF3fmUya7u3hMcjsCpREkSDN7I5wzeyOc\"/><figcaption>Julian狂掹頭髮，睇到都痛。(ig@sysleungx)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Shirley更分享了家中的小狗對弟弟Julian的「保護慾」，見到「三哥」Pickle在伍富橋照顧Julian時在旁像監工一樣「𥄫到實」。(ig@sysleungx)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261028/1192194704196767744209465.jpeg/zRRGtjieVLinHyP9tNzhfZjH4HtPJmWGz27CMs9uwjI\"/><figcaption>Shirley更分享了家中的小狗對弟弟Julian的「保護慾」，見到「三哥」Pickle在伍富橋照顧Julian時在旁像監工一樣「𥄫到實」。(ig@sysleungx)</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T11:41:47.438486+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":669,"images":5,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T11:29:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T11:38:36.327980+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T11:38:36.327980+00:00","content_hash":"5b84f0069214ae358677da9b44d5ddb9e04f184cecc69746e22af4eaef6daae8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}